flowchart TD
  Question[PFAS research question] --> Provenance[Validate contrast tables and provenance]
  Provenance --> Audit[Reconstruct initial analytical approach]
  Audit --> Corrections[Apply methodological corrections]
  Corrections --> Stability[Estimate optimizer, resampling, and consensus stability]
  Stability --> Interpretation[Generate qualified statistical and functional results]

  Researcher[Researcher request] --> Compatibility[Interpret request and check dataset compatibility]
  Evidence[(Versioned methods, schemas, references, and decision records)] --> Planning[Create cited typed workflow plan]
  Compatibility --> Planning
  Planning --> Rules[Validate parameters, scientific rules, and unsupported claims]
  Rules -->|unsupported or incomplete| Abstain[Abstain or request clarification]
  Rules -->|review required| Review[Human scientific review]
  Review -->|approved plan digest| Execute[Run allowlisted operation]

  Provenance --> Execute
  Interpretation --> Execute
  Execute --> Report[Traceable tables, figures, hashes, findings, and review status]
  Report --> Quality[Automated tests and scientific quality control]
